{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233400","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423340001:1":{"text":"제이미, 무슨 일은 없었어?","source_cn":"詹米，你没出什么事吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09634E854622F92F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423340002:1":{"text":"엄마! 난 괜찮아! 시나랑 다른 애들이랑 같이 숨바꼭질 하고 있었어.","source_cn":"妈妈，我没事！我只是跟希娜他们去玩捉迷藏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1EAAAF5596F4DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423340003:1":{"text":"제이미를 데려와주셔서 정말 고맙습니다... 시나는요? 다른 친구들은 안 왔나요?","source_cn":"多谢你们这些好心人带詹米回来……希娜他们呢，没有回来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B3CC976B89DE1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423340004:1":{"text":"죄송해요. 다른 아이들은 더 놀겠다고 해서 못 데려왔어요...","source_cn":"抱歉，他们还想继续玩游戏，没有回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFE6F1A4A86D6B1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423340005:1":{"text":"아휴, 정말 속 썩이는 애들이라니까...","source_cn":"唉，真是让人不省心的孩子啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738C8F7010B0381A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423340006:1":{"text":"그 아이들의 상황을... 들려주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"那几个孩子的情况……可以跟我们说说吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34AFFFCA326237FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423340007:1":{"text":"...그 애들은 전부 부모 없이 자란 고아들이에요. 산이며 들을 쏘다니면서 사는 애들이라 이웃들이 가끔씩 돌봐주곤 했어요.","source_cn":"……他们都是无父无母的孤儿，从小在山野里摸爬滚生存，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C7495B4E1E99081","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423340008:1":{"text":"그 무리의 대장은 시나라고 하는 아이예요. 시나의 어머니는 그 애를 낳고 왕성의 하인으로 들어간 뒤에 돌아오지 않았지요...","source_cn":"那个领头的女孩叫希娜。希娜的母亲在生下希娜后去王城当了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5790AEFACC2B6CC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423340009:1":{"text":"시나는 대담하고 재빨라서 아이들의 대장을 맡고 있죠. 솔직히, 그 애들은 시나의 말 밖에 듣지 않아요.","source_cn":"希娜胆子大，又身手矫健，如今是这些孩子的头儿，可以说，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA64B7EB4A0C8BEF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423340010:1":{"text":"하지만 시나는 고집이 센 건지 반항심이 강한 건지, 늘 어른들의 말을 듣지 않더군요. 항상 저렇게 놀면서... 걱정은 되지만 어쩔 수가 없어요.","source_cn":"但希娜，该说是执拗还是叛逆呢？总是跟大人们对着干。这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BC8AE41F7215290","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423340011:1":{"text":"아이들이 커서 귀족의 하인이 되겠다고 했어요... 하지만 이제 귀족이나 평민, 하인에도 구분이 없는데...","source_cn":"那些孩子还提到长大后去做贵族的仆从……可是现在已经没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43EA2B2E17CD21BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423340012:1":{"text":"원한다면 자유롭게 왕성으로 가서 자기 꿈을 펼칠 수 있어요.","source_cn":"如果他们想的话，他们可以自由前往王城，靠一技之长谋生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F877561507E6721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423340013:1":{"text":"아무도 아이들에게 그런 변화를 알려주지 않은 거겠죠...","source_cn":"我想根本没有人告诉他们这些变化吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7934C6FAF09B620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423340014:1":{"text":"그런 변화는... 우리 어른들도 어떻게 해야 할 지 모르겠는데, 아이들은 말할 것도 없을 거고요.","source_cn":"对于这些变化，我们大人都不知道该做些什么，该往哪走……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28C4AA22982FE47F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1423340015:1":{"text":"이 아이들... 혹시 평민 지역에 이 아이들을 가르쳐줄 학교나 선생님은 없나요?","source_cn":"这些孩子……平民区没有学校和老师愿意接收他们，让他们学习吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43EC3111FF89ACCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1423340016:1":{"text":"학교, 선생님... 그런 건 제사장 귀족들 같은 돈 많은 사람들이나 가질 수 있는 거예요. 저희 평민들은 애초에 바랄 수도 없는 거고요.","source_cn":"学校、老师……这些都是祭司贵族之类的富裕人家才能负担得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC87C0041767A4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1423340017:1":{"text":"게다가 여기에 오겠다는 선생님도 없을 거예요...","source_cn":"而且，不会有老师愿意来这里的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22E694962049AEEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1423340018:1":{"text":"그런 거였군요...","source_cn":"原来是这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75901F66C2633FA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1423340019:0":{"text":"아이들 사정을 알고 나니 분위기가 한층 무거워졌다...","source_cn":"知道了这些孩子的真实情况后，气氛一时有些凝重……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAF2C027FD684A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1423340020:1":{"text":"...죄송해요. 지금 당장은 도와드릴 수 있는 게 없겠어요. 시간도 늦었으니 오로나를 데리고 돌아갈까요?","source_cn":"……抱歉，我们目前还帮不上什么忙……时间不早了，我们送...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98B85A68E3F69865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1423340020":{"text":"...죄송해요. 지금 당장은 도와드릴 수 있는 게 없겠어요. 시간도 늦었으니 오로나를 데리고 돌아갈까요?","source_cn":"……抱歉，我们目前还帮不上什么忙……时间不早了，我们送欧罗娜回去吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98B85A68E3F69865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1423340021:3":{"text":"제이미, 잘 있어요. 또 만날 수 있으면 좋겠네요!","source_cn":"詹米，再见啦，希望我们还能再见到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1577EF3E38703E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1423340022:1":{"text":"안녕히 가세요. 집에 데려다 주셔서 고맙습니다!","source_cn":"再见……谢谢你们带詹米回家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89F2432739DDB808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1423340023:1":{"text":"...아, 이거 선물로 줄게요.","source_cn":"……对了！这个送给你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x012511EB9B05EBD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1423340024:1":{"text":"책이에요! 안에 재미있는 이야기가 많이 적혀 있어요!","source_cn":"这个是一本书哦！上面写了很多有趣的事情呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30D585E1FC7A53C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1423340025:1":{"text":"심심할 때 읽어도 좋고, 친구들이랑 같이 읽어도 좋아요!","source_cn":"你无聊的时候可以多读读看！也可以和你的朋友们一起读！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A66797AF88AD0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1423340026:1":{"text":"이건... 책이네요? 고마워요, 누나.","source_cn":"这是……书吗？谢谢你，大姐姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A74562479082AF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:0:1":{"text":"제이미에게 인사라도 하자","source_cn":"跟詹米打个招呼吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x290EAFF56DD73EE5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제이미에게 인사라도 하자","female":"제이미에게 인사라도 하자","variant_male_record_index":"73914","variant_female_record_index":"73915","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:1:2":{"text":"제이미에게 작별 인사라도 하자","source_cn":"跟詹米告个别吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBEAC553C0413FD2A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제이미에게 작별 인사라도 하자","female":"제이미에게 작별 인사라도 하자","variant_male_record_index":"73916","variant_female_record_index":"73917","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民胡丽诺":{"text":"평민 헤리나","source":"平民胡丽诺","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","source":"詹米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","stat